@@ -0,0 +1,308 @@
+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2001 Peter Kelly (pmk@post.com)
+ * Copyright (C) 2001 Tobias Anton (anton@stud.fbi.fh-darmstadt.de)
+ * Copyright (C) 2006 Samuel Weinig (sam.weinig@gmail.com)
